    "text": "Let in a&nbsp;<math><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo></math> vertex <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;the circumcentre <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> and the orthocentre <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> respectively, then mid-point of the side <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is"
