  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0072_84de50881921.png\" style=\"width:3.48056in;height:0.72014in\" /><br />We know that centroid divides orthocentre and cirumcentre in the ratio <math><mn>2</mn><mi></mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Hence, centroid <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> is the mid-point of side <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> then <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></math> also divides <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> in the ratio <math><mn>2</mn><mi></mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0072_3fcc78e7bd98.png\" style=\"width:2.94722in;height:0.59306in\" /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>"
